          description: 'Once the maths says surrender: branch-only submission, documents, and the 7–15 working day NEFT timeline.',
          url: '/guides/lic-surrender-form-5074-branch-process/',
          category: 'Surrender',
          type: 'guide'
        },
        {
          title: 'Stop Paying LIC Premium After 3 Years? Paid-Up Value You Will Get at Maturity',
          description: 'The paid-up alternative in full: reduced maturity value, bonus freeze, and the 5-year revival window.',
          url: '/guides/lic-paid-up-vs-surrender/',
          category: 'Surrender',
          type: 'guide'
        },
        {
          title: 'LIC Money-Back vs Endowment: Which Plan Actually Suits You?',
          description: 'Why money-back costs more per rupee of maturity than a plain endowment — and when the instalments are worth it.',
          url: '/guides/lic-money-back-vs-endowment/',
          category: 'Plan Comparisons',
          type: 'guide'
        }
      ]}
    />

    <!-- Author & Reviewer Trust Box -->
    <AuthorReviewerCard author={author} reviewer={reviewer} lastReviewedDate="November 2026" />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
